# Real spur.conf files contain host IPs and credentials — never commit them.
# Only the inventory/examples/*.example templates (placeholder addresses) are
# tracked. A real spur.conf is typically kept outside this repo entirely
# (it's now the -i inventory source, not something that lives under
# inventory/), but ignore it here too in case it's dropped in this tree.
spur.conf
inventory/*.ini
!inventory/*.example.ini

# Ansible runtime artifacts
*.retry
